# iOS
Everything for one run is written under Snapchat_Auto-<date_time>/, with the reports in Reports/
and index.html linking to them.

Reports/Conversations
  An index of every conversation plus one detail page per conversation (messages, senders,
  timestamps, attachments with hashes)

Reports/Contacts
  One table of every contact recovered from the friends artifact, linked to their conversation

Reports/Memories
  Info on all Memories and My Eyes Only, with all recovered media, hashes and geolocation

Reports/CacheController
  Every file indexed by cache_controller.db, linked to the on-disk cache files, Memories and chats

Reports/Communications_legacy
  The original single-page report: chats (text, saved and cached media), contacts and groups

Reports/LocalMemories_legacy
  The original Memories / My Eyes Only report, contains decrypted media if it is cached

SnapFixedVideos
  Contains media files that have been merged from split files
